                with st.expander(f"{tag}  {tk}  ${close:.2f}  |  5d {r5:+.1f}%  20d {r20:+.1f}%  Vol {vr:.1f}×", expanded=r5 > 15):
                    c1, c2, c3 = st.columns(3)
